<title>USA: Branford Savings Bank resumes qtrly div.</title>
<headline>Branford Savings Bank resumes qtrly div.</headline>
<dateline>BRANFORD, Conn. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Branford Savings Bank said on Friday it has resumed a policy of quarterly dividend payments, with an initial dividend of $0.02 a share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable November 15, 1996, to shareholders of record on October 30, the company said.</p>
<p>The last dividend paid by the bank was in February 1990, it said.</p>
</text>
